          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "the question is, which code do we have to write here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "to create our own widget class?",
