          "en": "And the answer to that is that you use the class keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 18.903,
          "en": "to tell Dart that you are about to create a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.883,
          "end": 22.833,
