          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 51.69,
          "en": "It's all one long word,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.69,
          "end": 53.4,
          "en": "but the words inside of the word",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 56.073,
          "en": "start with another capital character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.24,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "So, that's then the name of your class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 61.14,
          "en": "and as mentioned, it is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "It should just follow some general rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.73,
          "en": "regarding how the name is written",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.73,
          "end": 69.03,
          "en": "and it should also describe what the class is about,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 71.91,
          "en": "so which kind of object will be created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.91,
          "end": 75.66,
          "en": "And here, my idea is to create a container widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.66,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "that will come with a gradient already applied to it,",
