        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.21,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "from which you wanna to inherit and inheriting from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "That widget does a couple of things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.55,
          "end": 152.94,
          "en": "Most importantly, it automatically, behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.94,
          "end": 156.9,
          "en": "adds a lot of logic and data to this class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.9,
          "end": 160.65,
          "en": "without you writing anything between these curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.65,
          "end": 165.24,
          "en": "It adds a lot of data and logic that is required by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.24,
          "end": 168.723,
          "en": "in order to use this as a widget and add this to a UI.",
