        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.07,
          "end": 191.4,
          "en": "Most importantly, I'm missing a method called build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.4,
          "end": 194.1,
          "en": "So therefore, to correctly extend this widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 198.32999999999998,
          "en": "you should add a new method here called build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 201.27,
          "en": "with parentheses and opening and closing curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.27,
          "end": 203.7,
          "en": "so just as you would define a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 205.8,
          "en": "but now inside of a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.8,
          "end": 208.23,
          "en": "and you can add functions to classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.23,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "We then call these functions typically methods,",
