        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "but it's, in the end, just a function added to a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.44,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "so in the end, bound to that class.",
