          "end": 378.84,
          "en": "Now, how do you return a value in Dart?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.84,
          "end": 380.37,
          "en": "Well, inside of the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.37,
          "end": 382.83,
          "en": "or method that should return a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 382.83,
          "end": 385.11,
          "en": "you use the return keyword,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 385.11,
          "end": 388.14,
          "en": "and then thereafter, the value you want to return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 388.14,
          "end": 391.05,
          "en": "And when a function or method returns a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
